    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d29">

                <pb facs="0061" n="45" xml:id="pg45"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">710.J/4–1448</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of the Treasury</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Snyder</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                            State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-04-14">April 14, 1948</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Lovett</hi>: I refer to the message
                    which I received from Secretary Marshall on April 13 (Niact, Martel 46, April
                        12<anchor n="1" xml:id="d29-f1"/>).</p>
                <p>Will you please inform Secretary Marshall that the National Advisory Council, at
                    a special meeting on April 13, approved the granting of a $10 million emergency
                    reconstruction loan by the Export-Import Bank to finance U.S. equipment and
                    materials to repair the recent destruction in Colombia.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d29-f2"/>
                </p>
                <p>Very truly yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">John</hi> W. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Snyder</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Chairman</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">National Advisory Council on International Monetary and
                        Financial Problems</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d29-f1" n="1" xml:id="d29-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d29-f2" n="2" xml:id="d29-f2-content">
                <p>For a statement on the authorization of a credit to Colombia of $10 million, see
                    the sixth semiannual report of the Export-Import Bank of Washington to Congress
                    for the period January-June 1948, <ref target="#pg6">p. 6</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
